  "priorExpiration": "2011-12-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 568.07 Utilization Review and Control. The department’s program integrity unit shall monitor utilization of physical therapy, occupational therapy and services for individuals with speech, hearing and language disorders, in accordance with 42 CFR 455, 42 CFR 456, 42 CFR 1001, and He-W 520.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #4995, eff 11-30-90, EXPIRED: 11-30-96\n\nNew. #7909, eff 6-24-03; ss by #9929, INTERIM, eff 6-19-11, EXPIRES: 12-16-11; ss by #10042, eff 12-16-11; ss by #13355, eff 3-19-22",
